{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486250/extras/DTitleEng-1.jpg?t=1741577901\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You must have played many ball-rolling games, but I bet you've never rolled two balls at the same time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a game that requires coordination, but it's your left and right hands working together\u2014just like Zhou Botong's(One of the top kongfu master in Jin Yong's martial arts novels) legendary skill, the &quot;\u5de6\u53f3\u4e92\u640f&quot; (Mutual Combat of Left and Right). How about giving it a try?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486250/extras/ForGif-L3.gif?t=1741577901\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486250/extras/DTitle-2eng.jpg?t=1741577901\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow your instincts, endure the trials, and press onward with unwavering resolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And perhaps, maybe... it's not as straightforward as it seems!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to explore the world of DBall~~~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3486250/extras/2\u67087\u65e5-2.gif?t=1741577901\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Maybe you still want something more ? Who knows.....</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Whispers of the mystic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3486250/a6338e783c1f0e705bf972306f0c694b41123683.jpg"},{"name":"Awakening from Dust","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3486250/019846cb092c6b4e9a7e5e1986fa18dff3469f63.jpg"},{"name":